---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Me"
  description="Miami native turned SEO Director at uSERP. Built a travel blog to 2M impressions, now driving 300%+ traffic growth for B2B SaaS companies."
  currentSlug="about-me"
  isHomepage={true}
>
  <p class="last-login" data-last-login hidden></p>
  <p class="echo" aria-hidden="true"><span class="cwd">~</span><span class="chev"></span><span class="cmd">whoami</span></p>
  <h1 class="page-title name">robert lora</h1>
  <p class="role">director of SEO at <a href="https://userp.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">uSERP</a></p>
  <p class="opener">spent 5 years catching money launderers. taught myself SEO. turns out I'm better at this.</p>

  <div class="hero-grid">
    <div class="hero-proof">
      <h2 class="sr-only">three results</h2>
      <ul class="proof">
        <li><a href="/case-studies/#onboard"><span class="num">+337%</span><span class="lbl">organic traffic, onboard</span><span class="go"><span class="go-text">see case</span><span class="go-chev" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></a></li>
        <li><a href="/case-studies/#blink"><span class="num">92%</span><span class="lbl">AI mode visibility, blink</span><span class="go"><span class="go-text">see case</span><span class="go-chev" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></a></li>
        <li><a href="/case-studies/#form-health"><span class="num">24K → 94K</span><span class="lbl">form health, under a year</span><span class="go"><span class="go-text">see case</span><span class="go-chev" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></a></li>
      </ul>
      <p class="actions">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="mailto:rjlora@gmail.com">email me</a>
        <a class="btn" href="/case-studies/">see the work</a>
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-fetch">
      <p class="echo" aria-hidden="true"><span class="cwd">~</span><span class="chev"></span><span class="cmd">neofetch</span></p>
      <div class="fetch">
        <figure class="portrait-slot portrait" data-portrait>
          <img src="/me.webp" width="480" height="480" alt="robert lora" decoding="async" />
          <canvas width="480" height="480" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
          <figcaption aria-hidden="true">me.jpg</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <div class="fetch-info">
          <p class="fetch-host"><span class="u">robert</span>: <span class="h">~/barcelona</span></p>
          <p class="fetch-rule" aria-hidden="true">─────────────</p>
          <dl class="kv">
            <div><dt>role</dt><dd>director of SEO at uSERP</dd></div>
            <div><dt>agency</dt><dd>a link building and SEO agency</dd></div>
            <div><dt>portfolio</dt><dd>~$1M B2B client portfolio</dd></div>
            <div><dt>base</dt><dd>miami kid, based in barcelona</dd></div>
            <div><dt>builds</dt><dd>45 systems with claude code</dd></div>
          </dl>
          <p class="swatches" aria-hidden="true"><i class="s0"></i><i class="s1"></i><i class="s2"></i><i class="s3"></i><i class="s4"></i><i class="s5"></i><i class="s6"></i><i class="s7"></i></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="echo" aria-hidden="true"><span class="cwd">~</span><span class="chev"></span><span class="cmd">cat the-path-here.md</span></p>
  <div class="prose">
    <h2 class="sec-title">the path here</h2>
    <ol class="path">
      <li><span class="when">5 years</span><span class="what">fraud analyst at the miami agency of peru's largest bank, catching money launderers.</span></li>
      <li><span class="when">then</span><span class="what">quit, left miami to backpack through asia and europe.</span></li>
      <li><span class="when">montenegro</span><span class="what">taught myself SEO. built a travel blog to 2M impressions.</span></li>
      <li><span class="when">2018</span><span class="what">first agency gig at organic growth marketing, on <a href="https://www.bigcommerce.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">bigcommerce</a> before its IPO.</span></li>
      <li><span class="when">6 years</span><span class="what">wired rhino. grew chamberofcommerce.org 363%.</span></li>
      <li><span class="when">director</span><span class="what">made director at <a href="https://seeker.digital/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">seeker digital</a>. ran SEO for <a href="https://orcascan.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">orca scan</a>, 50,000+ orgs on their barcode platform.</span></li>
      <li><span class="when">now</span><span class="what">director of SEO at <a href="https://userp.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">uSERP</a>. I've grown organic traffic 300%+ for companies like <a href="https://joinblink.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Blink</a>, <a href="https://onboardmeetings.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">OnBoard</a>, and <a href="https://www.formhealth.co/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Form Health</a>.</span></li>
    </ol>
    <h2 class="sec-title">currently into</h2>
    <p>building tools with claude code. 45 systems so far: 9 custom MCP servers, multi-agent research orchestrators, GEO optimization tools. I don't really separate "doing SEO" from "building the tools to do it" anymore.</p>
    <p>when I'm not in search console I'm dancing salsa or building things with <a href="/builds/">claude code</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
